WEBVTT

01:42.000 --> 01:44.640
Three, two, one!

01:44.720 --> 01:46.000
Say cheese.

01:46.880 --> 01:48.360
Wishing you a happy marriage.

01:48.400 --> 01:49.360
Thanks.

01:49.520 --> 01:50.640
Happy wedding.

01:50.680 --> 01:51.240
Let's go.

01:51.240 --> 01:51.960
Take care.

01:51.960 --> 01:52.720
I'll walk you out.

01:52.720 --> 01:53.160
I'll see you off.

01:53.160 --> 01:54.160
Bye.

01:54.640 --> 01:55.440
Wu's here.

01:55.520 --> 01:56.200
Thanks.

01:56.240 --> 01:57.039
I'm off.

01:57.920 --> 01:59.039
Sorry I'm late.

01:59.080 --> 02:01.120
Wu, what took you so long?

02:01.520 --> 02:02.120
Happy wedding.

02:02.320 --> 02:04.160
You're late. Qing Ye already left.

02:04.520 --> 02:05.920
Wu, why are you just getting back?

02:06.320 --> 02:07.800
You're too late.

02:08.160 --> 02:09.280
My flight got delayed today.

02:09.720 --> 02:10.440
Wu, listen,

02:10.440 --> 02:11.320
you seriously missed

02:11.320 --> 02:12.920
quite a scene at Zhazhating.

02:13.520 --> 02:14.120
What a shame.

02:14.600 --> 02:15.280
I'll catch it next time.

02:15.560 --> 02:16.000
No worries.

02:16.840 --> 02:18.160
Wait until Kyle's wedding.

02:18.880 --> 02:19.800
Wait until... my wedding?

02:20.400 --> 02:21.200
We're all waiting for you.

02:21.960 --> 02:22.640
Well, let's go

02:22.640 --> 02:23.760
see the guests off.

02:23.800 --> 02:24.120
Okay.

02:24.400 --> 02:24.880
Let's go.

02:24.960 --> 02:25.360
- Alright.
- Wu.

02:25.520 --> 02:26.000
You guys carry on.

02:26.000 --> 02:26.520
You guys take your time.

02:27.120 --> 02:28.280
Go ahead.

02:28.320 --> 02:29.240
Have a good talk with him.

02:32.040 --> 02:32.680
Wu.

02:33.480 --> 02:34.079
Well?

02:34.600 --> 02:35.160
Jealous?

02:35.760 --> 02:36.880
Look how happy they are.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.400
I'm starting to look forward to marriage.

02:39.600 --> 02:40.079
You?

02:41.320 --> 02:42.760
Get yourself a girlfriend first.

02:43.360 --> 02:44.520
Why does that sound like

02:44.520 --> 02:45.680
an insult coming from you?

02:45.960 --> 02:46.800
What, you've got one?

02:49.880 --> 02:50.520
Come on.

02:50.640 --> 02:51.360
We haven't taken one yet.

02:51.360 --> 02:51.960
Let's take a picture together.

02:52.400 --> 02:52.880
Move back a bit.

02:54.040 --> 02:54.680
The light's good here. Come on.

02:55.880 --> 02:58.040
Three, two, one.

02:59.920 --> 03:00.360
Okay.

03:01.520 --> 03:02.320
I'm gonna post this on Moments.

03:12.440 --> 03:13.320
You sure know where to sit.

03:13.520 --> 03:14.440
Qing Ye was sitting right there.

03:16.760 --> 03:17.280
Really?

04:26.520 --> 04:27.440
Mom, let me do it.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.640
Don't bother.

04:28.680 --> 04:29.880
You just relax.

04:30.440 --> 04:31.360
You're hardly ever home.

04:34.320 --> 04:35.000
Actually,

04:35.920 --> 04:36.760
I need to tell you something.

04:37.280 --> 04:37.680
Go ahead.

04:38.440 --> 04:39.720
I'm planning to go work in Beijing.

04:41.000 --> 04:41.880
Beijing?

04:42.520 --> 04:44.040
Did you get the internship sorted?

04:44.480 --> 04:45.080
It's set.

04:45.600 --> 04:46.360
Professor Lu recommended me

04:46.360 --> 04:47.560
for an internship at Aofei Group.

04:47.840 --> 04:48.960
I'll be doing grad school and working

04:49.000 --> 04:50.120
on projects at the same time.

04:50.560 --> 04:52.720
Aofei Group?

04:53.720 --> 04:54.920
The one that makes airplanes?

04:57.240 --> 04:58.000
Yeah, I know.

04:58.000 --> 04:59.000
You can't say anything.

04:59.000 --> 04:59.760
It's a secret.

05:00.680 --> 05:02.520
But after I get to Beijing,

05:02.560 --> 05:03.600
I'll probably be pretty busy.

05:04.280 --> 05:04.920
Might

05:05.880 --> 05:07.000
not be able to come back often.

05:10.440 --> 05:11.280
That's okay.

05:11.920 --> 05:13.080
You just focus

05:13.720 --> 05:14.960
on your studies and work

05:15.600 --> 05:16.400
in Beijing.

05:16.920 --> 05:17.680
I'll

05:17.840 --> 05:18.880
stay here in Zhazhating

05:18.920 --> 05:20.360
and be my career woman.

05:21.200 --> 05:23.120
When I have time,

05:23.240 --> 05:24.360
I'll come visit you in Beijing.

05:26.920 --> 05:27.360
Oh,

05:28.400 --> 05:29.120
hang on.

05:30.120 --> 05:30.920
Since you're going to Beijing,

05:30.920 --> 05:31.640
help me with something.

05:32.360 --> 05:32.880
What's this?

05:33.240 --> 05:34.000
Remember

05:34.000 --> 05:35.760
when our house caught fire

05:36.000 --> 05:37.000
and Ye's dad

05:37.000 --> 05:38.720
lent us a hundred thousand?

05:38.840 --> 05:40.320
We said we'd pay him back.

05:40.520 --> 05:41.720
Just return it for me.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.000
Keep this money.

05:43.000 --> 05:44.520
Hey, you're gonna have to

05:44.520 --> 05:45.360
get along with Ye.

05:45.360 --> 05:46.240
This way

05:46.240 --> 05:47.400
you're debt-free.

05:47.400 --> 05:48.680
I already paid it back.

05:49.800 --> 05:50.720
You paid it back?

05:51.560 --> 05:52.120
Yes.

05:52.920 --> 05:54.000
When did you pay it back?

05:58.600 --> 05:59.120
Mr. Qing,

05:59.720 --> 06:01.240
you lent our family money back then.

06:01.880 --> 06:03.080
Now I'm paying you back

06:04.360 --> 06:05.120
with interest.

06:12.800 --> 06:13.600
I never

06:14.560 --> 06:16.080
meant for you to pay it back.

06:16.600 --> 06:17.880
But it doesn't mean

06:18.160 --> 06:19.600
we shouldn't pay it back.

06:20.520 --> 06:21.160
Besides,

06:21.640 --> 06:22.200
my mom

06:22.200 --> 06:23.120
wrote an IOU back then.

06:24.080 --> 06:24.760
Please take it.

06:25.440 --> 06:26.520
A hundred thousand.

06:27.520 --> 06:29.320
That's no small amount.

06:29.880 --> 06:31.360
No wonder you didn't come home for winter

06:31.360 --> 06:33.000
or summer break these past few years.

06:34.440 --> 06:35.520
You've been through a lot, Wu.

06:36.120 --> 06:36.960
Not really.

06:37.159 --> 06:38.520
I designed

06:38.560 --> 06:40.000
a flight vehicle propulsion model.

06:40.640 --> 06:42.440
A company bought the patent.

06:43.080 --> 06:43.760
And they give me dividends

06:43.760 --> 06:44.600
every year.

06:45.600 --> 06:46.440
Dividends?

06:46.840 --> 06:47.520
How much?

06:49.960 --> 06:50.640
I'm not telling you.

06:52.320 --> 06:53.560
Fine, don't tell me then.

06:54.520 --> 06:55.840
I'm not telling you so you'll be

06:55.840 --> 06:57.280
more motivated to earn money.

06:58.880 --> 07:01.160
I'm very motivated now.

07:01.200 --> 07:02.760
I'm opening a branch

07:02.760 --> 07:04.560
in Anzi County.

07:05.280 --> 07:06.080
Keep it up.

07:09.040 --> 07:10.880
Oh, since you're going to Beijing,

07:11.000 --> 07:12.080
go see Ye often.

07:12.160 --> 07:13.360
Keep in touch with her.

07:16.160 --> 07:16.560
Okay.

07:16.720 --> 07:17.800
You gotta keep your word.

07:19.560 --> 07:20.000
Of course.

07:26.320 --> 07:28.000
Wu left already?

07:29.320 --> 07:30.040
He's going to Beijing.

07:31.040 --> 07:32.200
His advisor

07:32.280 --> 07:33.840
thinks very highly of him.

07:34.720 --> 07:35.960
He set up an internship for him

07:35.960 --> 07:37.560
in Beijing.

07:37.760 --> 07:39.560
That's fantastic news.

07:39.560 --> 07:40.000
Yeah.

07:40.240 --> 07:41.040
Cici.

07:41.360 --> 07:42.840
Your family just had a happy occasion.

07:43.159 --> 07:44.760
Now another great thing.

07:44.920 --> 07:47.159
That's double happiness.

07:48.000 --> 07:48.680
Wu

07:48.760 --> 07:49.880
has had it pretty tough.

07:50.520 --> 07:51.800
After all he's been through,

07:52.120 --> 07:53.600
he still got into a good college,

07:53.680 --> 07:54.680
achieved his dream,

07:54.960 --> 07:56.280
and now he's going to Beijing.

07:56.840 --> 07:58.560
He's seriously an inspiration.

07:58.840 --> 08:00.120
Wu saved up

08:00.680 --> 08:02.400
a hundred thousand over the years.

08:02.960 --> 08:04.000
Without telling me,

08:04.080 --> 08:04.760
he just paid it back

08:04.760 --> 08:05.720
to Ye's dad.

08:06.600 --> 08:07.720
I can imagine

08:08.000 --> 08:09.200
how much hardship

08:09.280 --> 08:10.240
he must've gone through out there.

08:10.560 --> 08:12.560
Wu is so mature for his age.

08:12.840 --> 08:14.280
He carries everything on his own.

08:14.320 --> 08:14.920
Yeah.

08:15.520 --> 08:16.320
He's like

08:16.320 --> 08:17.520
an angel boy.

08:18.200 --> 08:19.520
I've been blessed.

08:19.640 --> 08:21.360
Thanks to your angel boy

08:21.400 --> 08:22.560
for looking after Big G.

08:22.800 --> 08:23.560
That kid

08:23.680 --> 08:24.920
finally puts my mind at ease.

08:25.520 --> 08:26.600
I'm going to start

08:26.960 --> 08:28.600
chasing my new life

08:28.760 --> 08:29.760
and career.

08:29.760 --> 08:31.200
- What do you want to do?
- What do you want to do?

08:31.920 --> 08:32.720
I also want to

08:33.960 --> 08:34.679
go live.

08:35.880 --> 08:36.360
Is that okay?

08:36.919 --> 08:38.720
- Sure.
- Absolutely.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.520
Right.

08:39.840 --> 08:40.960
But I'm not like you.

08:40.960 --> 08:41.720
I don't have

08:41.720 --> 08:43.000
a special skill.

08:43.360 --> 08:45.400
I just know how to make noodles

08:45.480 --> 08:46.200
and dumplings.

08:46.400 --> 08:47.520
That's perfect.

08:47.880 --> 08:49.360
You just livestream yourself cooking

08:49.560 --> 08:50.320
and sell stuff.

08:50.400 --> 08:50.760
Right.

08:50.760 --> 08:52.040
Plus, Zhazhating

08:52.040 --> 08:53.280
has so many unique things.

08:53.400 --> 08:54.720
And all that seafood.

08:54.960 --> 08:55.720
Just go for it.

08:56.160 --> 08:56.840
No rush.

08:57.200 --> 08:59.160
Lanfang, I'll learn from you.

08:59.880 --> 09:01.960
I'll take my time.

09:02.080 --> 09:03.360
But I need to set a goal.

09:03.640 --> 09:04.760
I want to be

09:04.840 --> 09:07.600
a streamer with over 100,000 followers!

09:08.160 --> 09:08.720
You

09:09.160 --> 09:10.280
can do it!

09:10.360 --> 09:10.840
You

09:11.040 --> 09:12.720
got this!

09:17.680 --> 09:18.560
Our development direction

09:18.560 --> 09:19.440
and core strategy

09:19.440 --> 09:20.360
are divided into three parts.

09:21.280 --> 09:22.720
What you're seeing now

09:22.720 --> 09:24.360
is the core area of the Chang Island

09:24.360 --> 09:25.200
aquaculture farm.

09:25.520 --> 09:26.760
We're planning

09:26.760 --> 09:28.200
a full industrial chain upgrade

09:28.240 --> 09:29.840
and a new sales model.

09:30.040 --> 09:31.240
Like, the significance of building

09:31.240 --> 09:32.560
a cold chain logistics transfer station.

09:32.800 --> 09:33.360
Of course,

09:33.360 --> 09:35.600
besides upgrading

09:35.600 --> 09:36.520
cold chain logistics,

09:36.520 --> 09:37.520
we'll also

09:37.640 --> 09:39.200
develop tourism

09:39.400 --> 09:40.920
by taking advantage of Chang Island's

09:40.920 --> 09:42.120
pristine natural environment.

09:42.400 --> 09:44.520
This includes sightseeing boardwalks,

09:44.600 --> 09:46.080
sea fishing, family beachcombing,

09:46.400 --> 09:47.640
and bonfires.

09:48.360 --> 09:49.120
Beyond that,

09:49.120 --> 09:50.080
the most important thing is

09:50.320 --> 09:50.960
that our project

09:50.960 --> 09:52.080
has strong support

09:52.080 --> 09:52.960
from the local government.

09:53.240 --> 09:54.200
So I believe

09:54.360 --> 09:55.600
it will go

09:55.720 --> 09:56.520
very smoothly.

09:56.840 --> 09:57.720
That's the overall

09:57.720 --> 09:59.640
cooperation plan

09:59.840 --> 10:01.080
between Guanshan Venture Capital

10:01.080 --> 10:02.080
and Creation Technology.

10:03.600 --> 10:04.520
For us,

10:04.760 --> 10:06.880
Creation Technology's farmer-support project

10:07.120 --> 10:08.680
is more than just profit.

10:09.040 --> 10:10.280
It's about passion.

10:10.920 --> 10:12.280
We're not just

10:12.360 --> 10:14.600
investing in seafood,

10:15.160 --> 10:16.120
but more so

10:16.200 --> 10:17.680
in the people who produce it.

10:17.840 --> 10:19.520
The fishermen of Chang Island

10:19.760 --> 10:20.720
live by the sea.

10:21.280 --> 10:22.240
They are as resilient as water

10:22.680 --> 10:23.520
and as profound as the ocean.

10:23.680 --> 10:25.240
They have tenacious vitality

10:25.440 --> 10:26.720
and a hardworking, pragmatic spirit.

10:27.080 --> 10:29.000
To others, the seafood farmer-support project

10:29.520 --> 10:32.360
may be a blind spot

10:32.800 --> 10:33.800
or a tough job,

10:34.320 --> 10:35.640
but to us,

10:37.200 --> 10:39.120
it's a treasure and a blue ocean.

10:52.240 --> 10:52.760
Thank you.

10:52.920 --> 10:53.560
Pleasure working together.

10:55.080 --> 10:56.400
Thank you all

10:56.400 --> 10:57.840
for your support and help.

10:57.920 --> 10:58.520
Thank you, everyone.

10:59.120 --> 10:59.520
Let's

10:59.560 --> 11:00.760
make this project a success together.

11:01.200 --> 11:02.920
Thanks for your efforts and contributions

11:02.960 --> 11:04.120
to the development of Chang Island.

11:04.160 --> 11:05.080
Wishing us a pleasant partnership.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.080
Pleasant partnership.

11:18.920 --> 11:19.640
Meng Ruihang?

11:22.360 --> 11:23.240
Why are you still here?

11:23.520 --> 11:24.360
Let's go together.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.520
I'll take you out to celebrate.

11:26.960 --> 11:28.600
This is just the beginning.

11:28.840 --> 11:30.520
I need to go do research on Chang Island.

11:31.120 --> 11:32.400
Right now it's all just concepts.

11:32.760 --> 11:34.000
There's still a lot of work ahead.

11:34.200 --> 11:35.840
Didn't you just go back to Zhazhating?

11:36.520 --> 11:37.280
Did you see Xing Wu?

11:44.560 --> 11:45.440
What's up?

11:49.520 --> 11:50.240
After this busy stretch,

11:50.400 --> 11:51.200
I'll treat you to a meal.

11:51.840 --> 11:52.600
I just

11:52.760 --> 11:54.280
want to go rest now.

11:55.200 --> 11:56.760
Alright. Go get some rest.

12:16.560 --> 12:17.120
Xing Wu!

12:18.760 --> 12:19.320
You're here.

12:20.120 --> 12:22.120
Sorry. Traffic was terrible.

12:22.680 --> 12:23.560
I should've picked you up.

12:24.520 --> 12:25.240
I had something today.

12:25.240 --> 12:25.960
Really couldn't get away.

12:26.280 --> 12:27.720
No worries. I made it anyway.

12:27.880 --> 12:28.960
Professor Lu specifically told me

12:29.240 --> 12:30.320
to book a private room to welcome you.

12:30.360 --> 12:31.000
He'll be here soon.

12:31.040 --> 12:31.680
Let's head inside.

12:32.200 --> 12:33.400
Fine. Since you're late,

12:34.360 --> 12:35.000
you're carrying the luggage.

12:35.080 --> 12:35.760
Got it.

13:41.080 --> 13:42.000
See you at the usual place.

13:44.280 --> 13:45.040
What's up with you?

13:45.320 --> 13:46.520
Going out to eat this late.

13:47.400 --> 13:49.640
I was working late. Didn't have time to eat.

13:50.000 --> 13:50.960
I'm hungry now.

13:51.560 --> 13:52.120
Excuse me.

13:52.440 --> 13:52.880
Hello.

13:52.880 --> 13:54.120
What would you like to order?

13:54.240 --> 13:55.000
The usual three.

13:55.120 --> 13:56.040
Okay. One moment.

13:56.920 --> 13:58.040
You think I believe that?

13:58.320 --> 13:59.760
You coming to see me this late

13:59.760 --> 14:00.640
means something's up.

14:01.360 --> 14:02.160
I'm happy.

14:02.160 --> 14:03.560
I missed you, alright?

14:03.840 --> 14:04.720
Oh, please.

14:05.120 --> 14:06.160
We were roommates

14:06.160 --> 14:06.920
for four years.

14:07.160 --> 14:08.160
I know you well.

14:08.680 --> 14:09.280
Tell me the truth.

14:10.080 --> 14:10.720
Are you thinking

14:10.720 --> 14:11.600
about your old flame?

14:13.440 --> 14:14.520
No, I'm not.

14:14.600 --> 14:15.520
That's in the past.

14:16.560 --> 14:17.560
In the past?

14:18.200 --> 14:19.160
Then why

14:19.200 --> 14:20.440
have you been single for five years?

14:20.680 --> 14:21.520
I just

14:22.000 --> 14:23.120
haven't met the right person.

14:24.200 --> 14:25.000
Fine, fine.

14:28.880 --> 14:29.400
Professor Lu.

14:29.440 --> 14:29.920
Professor Lu.

14:29.920 --> 14:30.960
I'm late.

14:31.560 --> 14:32.720
No worries. We just got here.

14:32.920 --> 14:33.400
Have a seat.

14:33.400 --> 14:34.320
Come on. Sit down.

14:36.000 --> 14:36.520
Here.

14:37.000 --> 14:39.080
Here's to us being together

14:39.320 --> 14:39.840
again.

14:40.160 --> 14:40.600
Cheers.

14:41.040 --> 14:41.720
Thank you, Professor Lu.

14:42.040 --> 14:42.760
Thank you, Professor Lu.

14:50.240 --> 14:52.760
Here's your Aofei Group access card,

14:52.800 --> 14:54.360
meal card,

14:54.520 --> 14:55.200
and employee handbook.

14:55.920 --> 14:57.040
Starting tomorrow,

14:57.280 --> 14:58.000
you two

14:58.120 --> 14:59.960
will be colleagues on the project team.

15:00.680 --> 15:01.440
Do a good job.

15:02.320 --> 15:03.520
Professor Lu, thanks for the opportunity.

15:04.240 --> 15:04.680
Oh,

15:05.000 --> 15:05.520
Professor Lu,

15:05.640 --> 15:06.880
I just went back home.

15:06.960 --> 15:08.280
I brought you some local seafood.

15:08.400 --> 15:08.840
Alright.

15:09.320 --> 15:09.760
I'll leave it here.

15:09.760 --> 15:10.760
I'll take it to your car later.

15:10.840 --> 15:11.280
Okay.

15:15.960 --> 15:16.440
Spit it out.

15:17.000 --> 15:17.800
Why are you getting drunk?

15:19.320 --> 15:20.800
Because I'm not happy.

15:21.400 --> 15:23.080
Because of your old flame?

15:26.840 --> 15:28.120
I miss him.

15:28.760 --> 15:30.240
I miss him so much.

15:30.400 --> 15:31.960
I think about him every day.

15:32.360 --> 15:33.240
It's been five years.

15:34.240 --> 15:35.880
Doesn't he miss me at all?

15:36.640 --> 15:37.240
How can...

15:38.120 --> 15:39.520
How can he just

15:39.520 --> 15:40.920
never contact me?

15:41.120 --> 15:41.720
If you miss him,

15:41.720 --> 15:42.760
go find him.

15:44.320 --> 15:45.440
I have my pride.

15:45.600 --> 15:46.640
I was the one who said we should

15:46.640 --> 15:47.600
stop contacting each other.

15:48.400 --> 15:49.040
Why?

15:51.040 --> 15:52.760
I was trying to push him.

15:52.760 --> 15:54.000
I was afraid he'd give up.

15:54.400 --> 15:55.600
And he told me

15:55.600 --> 15:57.080
to move forward and not look back,

15:57.280 --> 15:58.520
that he'd catch up himself.

15:58.760 --> 16:00.120
You actually believed that?

16:00.600 --> 16:02.360
People change easily.

16:02.920 --> 16:03.840
To put it bluntly,

16:04.160 --> 16:05.520
he might have given up long ago.

16:06.040 --> 16:07.240
He might have even forgotten about you.

16:08.080 --> 16:09.560
Maybe he really has forgotten about me.

16:12.160 --> 16:13.080
Do you

16:13.520 --> 16:14.640
still have his contact info?

16:15.560 --> 16:16.920
I do have his phone number.

16:18.000 --> 16:18.640
Give me your phone.

16:19.720 --> 16:20.440
What for?

16:29.440 --> 16:30.560
Xing Wu, you

16:30.720 --> 16:31.680
just got to Beijing.

16:31.800 --> 16:32.680
Did you find a place yet?

16:33.320 --> 16:33.880
Found one.

16:34.040 --> 16:34.840
It's right near here.

16:36.000 --> 16:36.520
Professor,

16:36.520 --> 16:37.800
you know Xing Wu.

16:38.040 --> 16:38.640
He has to

16:38.720 --> 16:39.840
have everything prepared in advance.

16:41.280 --> 16:41.840
What about you?

16:42.320 --> 16:43.040
My sister's in Beijing.

16:43.400 --> 16:44.040
I'll stay with her.

16:44.240 --> 16:44.960
Good.

16:45.200 --> 16:46.120
You two,

16:46.640 --> 16:48.040
keep at it.

16:48.440 --> 16:49.520
Make a life for yourselves in Beijing.

16:49.640 --> 16:50.040
Here.

16:50.240 --> 16:50.720
For sure.

16:51.200 --> 16:51.600
Okay.

16:53.040 --> 16:54.560
The call just didn't go through.

16:54.920 --> 16:55.600
Look at you.

16:55.840 --> 16:56.560
You drank way too much.

16:56.640 --> 16:57.360
It's not a big deal.

16:58.120 --> 16:59.520
Maybe he just didn't see it.

17:00.360 --> 17:00.760
You...

17:00.840 --> 17:01.760
Want me to take you home?

17:02.280 --> 17:02.720
No need.

17:03.240 --> 17:04.280
My place is nearby.

17:04.280 --> 17:05.720
I'll take a walk and sober up.

17:06.680 --> 17:07.319
Your ride's here.

17:07.640 --> 17:08.920
Okay. You sure you're okay?

17:09.160 --> 17:09.640
Yes.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.280
Just text me when you get home.

17:11.400 --> 17:12.079
I'm off then.

17:12.079 --> 17:12.560
Bye.

17:12.640 --> 17:13.079
Bye.

17:37.000 --> 17:37.760
Okay. See you.

17:37.960 --> 17:38.400
Okay.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.160
Professor Lu, take care.

17:39.520 --> 17:40.080
- Okay.
- Take care.

17:50.800 --> 17:51.920
My ride will be here soon.

18:03.160 --> 18:04.800
People change easily.

18:05.320 --> 18:06.160
To put it bluntly,

18:06.440 --> 18:07.840
he might have given up long ago.

18:08.640 --> 18:10.640
He might have even forgotten about you.

18:15.240 --> 18:18.200
Xing Wu, did you really forget?

18:21.840 --> 18:22.960
Can we still spend

18:23.600 --> 18:24.960
next New Year's together?

18:27.080 --> 18:27.800
Where

18:28.960 --> 18:29.800
do you plan to be next year?

18:32.000 --> 18:33.160
That depends on how I do

18:33.520 --> 18:34.720
on my college entrance exam.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.200
If possible,

18:38.120 --> 18:39.360
I'd like to come back here.

19:19.680 --> 19:20.160
Hello?

19:21.120 --> 19:21.720
Where are you?

19:21.960 --> 19:23.440
I texted you, but you didn't reply.

19:24.800 --> 19:25.880
I'm near my place.

19:27.120 --> 19:27.960
Are you drunk?

19:28.560 --> 19:29.360
No, I'm not.

20:13.280 --> 20:13.920
Qing Ye.

20:14.400 --> 20:15.240
Why did you drink so much?

20:17.000 --> 20:18.320
Let me take you home.

20:49.840 --> 20:50.880
Have some water.

20:52.040 --> 20:52.640
Xing Wu.

20:54.600 --> 20:55.240
Xing Wu.

20:57.520 --> 20:58.600
Is that you?

21:07.800 --> 21:08.600
It's Meng Ruihang.

21:26.520 --> 21:27.320
Get some rest.

21:27.680 --> 21:28.360
I'm leaving.

22:26.680 --> 22:28.280
How did I get home yesterday?

22:37.920 --> 22:38.400
Hello?

22:38.760 --> 22:39.360
Are you awake?

22:40.520 --> 22:41.720
Just woke up.

22:42.080 --> 22:42.880
Are you okay?

22:44.360 --> 22:45.280
Yeah, I guess.

22:45.840 --> 22:46.640
A little dizzy.

22:47.760 --> 22:49.480
You drank too much last night.

22:49.880 --> 22:51.080
I couldn't stop you.

22:51.960 --> 22:52.840
Let me tell you,

22:54.560 --> 22:55.720
starting today,

22:56.120 --> 22:57.360
I'm quitting drinking for three months.

22:57.760 --> 22:58.520
Hold me to it.

22:59.080 --> 22:59.800
it's not the drinking

22:59.960 --> 23:01.240
you need to quit, but that person

23:01.440 --> 23:02.760
you're waiting for who's not coming.

23:03.040 --> 23:04.520
When one door closes, another opens.

23:04.640 --> 23:05.960
There's always a way forward.

23:06.760 --> 23:07.320
What,

23:07.720 --> 23:09.240
you gonna introduce me to a hot guy?

23:09.520 --> 23:10.240
You guessed it.

23:10.680 --> 23:11.920
Definitely good-looking

23:12.040 --> 23:12.760
and a good person.

23:12.960 --> 23:14.000
You're that sure?

23:14.200 --> 23:15.360
Because it's my own brother.

23:15.600 --> 23:16.520
He just got to Beijing.

23:16.920 --> 23:17.760
I'm hooking you up with him for free.

23:18.040 --> 23:18.760
Don't mess around.

23:18.760 --> 23:19.760
I can't handle that.

23:20.200 --> 23:21.520
Besides, I'm not interested in that now.

23:22.000 --> 23:23.360
Don't be formal with me.

23:23.760 --> 23:24.800
We're tight like that.

23:25.360 --> 23:26.320
Alright.

23:26.360 --> 23:27.560
Matchmaking time is over.

23:27.680 --> 23:28.440
I'm going to work.

23:28.760 --> 23:29.720
I have

23:29.720 --> 23:30.880
a project summary meeting today.

23:32.040 --> 23:32.840
I gotta go. Bye.

23:48.520 --> 23:49.360
Think about what I said

23:49.440 --> 23:50.080
this morning.

23:50.920 --> 23:51.680
You're serious?

23:51.760 --> 23:52.560
Of course.

23:52.960 --> 23:53.760
Let me give you

23:53.760 --> 23:54.600
a quick rundown.

23:54.680 --> 23:55.280
Just hear me out.

23:55.600 --> 23:56.520
I'm not interested.

23:56.560 --> 23:57.680
My brother, Qu Xing.

23:58.000 --> 23:58.880
Graduated from Northwestern Polytechnical University.

23:59.120 --> 24:00.200
He's in grad school now.

24:00.680 --> 24:02.080
He just got to Beijing a few days ago.

24:02.360 --> 24:03.680
He's working on a project

24:03.680 --> 24:05.120
at Aofei Group with his advisor.

24:06.880 --> 24:07.360
Great.

24:07.760 --> 24:08.600
Young and talented.

24:08.640 --> 24:09.120
What do you think?

24:10.240 --> 24:10.720
No.

24:11.440 --> 24:13.120
It's okay if you're not into my brother.

24:13.560 --> 24:14.840
If you want,

24:15.040 --> 24:16.280
he also has a colleague

24:16.360 --> 24:17.160
who just got to Beijing too.

24:17.640 --> 24:18.840
Let's grab dinner tonight.

24:19.320 --> 24:20.200
I owe him

24:20.200 --> 24:20.960
a welcome dinner anyway.

24:22.280 --> 24:23.360
Wait, why are you

24:23.800 --> 24:24.680
suddenly so eager

24:24.680 --> 24:25.800
to set me up?

24:26.360 --> 24:28.120
I just hate seeing you like this.

24:28.840 --> 24:29.600
They say

24:29.640 --> 24:31.240
you need to move on to get over someone.

24:31.640 --> 24:32.440
Actually,

24:32.600 --> 24:33.560
you only really move on

24:33.680 --> 24:34.560
when someone new comes along.

24:36.320 --> 24:36.880
Alright.

24:36.960 --> 24:38.200
Send me the time and place.

24:38.840 --> 24:39.400
So

24:40.080 --> 24:40.640
you're saying yes?

24:41.960 --> 24:42.920
You're buying anyway.

24:43.160 --> 24:44.320
I might as well come for the free meal.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.000
Qing Ye.

24:45.520 --> 24:46.120
Ms. Zhu, hello.

24:46.760 --> 24:47.280
Ms. Zhu.

24:47.520 --> 24:48.000
Qing Ye.

24:48.280 --> 24:49.040
Congratulations.

24:49.320 --> 24:50.320
Your project cleared the kickoff meeting.

24:50.720 --> 24:51.520
That fast?

24:52.720 --> 24:54.000
The board is very bullish

24:54.000 --> 24:54.520
on the project

24:54.600 --> 24:56.120
and says they'll go in big on it.

24:56.560 --> 24:58.240
Looks like what you dug up on that beach

24:58.240 --> 24:59.920
wasn't sand, but gold.

25:00.240 --> 25:01.040
Then I need to hurry up

25:01.160 --> 25:02.840
and go to Chang Island for a follow-up trip.

25:02.960 --> 25:03.720
Okay. Good luck.

25:10.640 --> 25:11.520
Mr. Xing, you're still busy?

25:17.160 --> 25:17.680
Xing,

25:18.360 --> 25:19.840
take a break. Perk up.

25:22.600 --> 25:23.800
I'm good. You have it.

25:25.680 --> 25:26.720
You really work hard.

25:27.760 --> 25:28.960
I just sent Professor Lu the design

25:29.000 --> 25:30.680
I stayed up several nights working on,

25:30.960 --> 25:32.000
and he sent me to help you.

25:32.880 --> 25:33.640
Don't even mention it.

25:34.320 --> 25:35.360
The dataset is too big.

25:35.440 --> 25:36.680
I went to the bathroom for a second

25:36.800 --> 25:37.720
and the processor crashed.

25:38.040 --> 25:38.520
My sister

25:39.240 --> 25:39.920
is buying dinner tonight.

25:39.920 --> 25:40.720
I'll bring you along.

25:41.040 --> 25:41.920
Consider it my apology.

25:42.440 --> 25:42.920
Okay?

25:43.520 --> 25:44.040
I'm not going.

25:45.440 --> 25:45.880
Hey,

25:46.040 --> 25:47.680
my sister specifically told me

25:47.880 --> 25:48.600
to bring the best guy

25:48.600 --> 25:49.840
I know

25:49.960 --> 25:50.920
to introduce to her friend.

25:51.040 --> 25:51.920
Don't say no.

25:52.520 --> 25:53.360
Thanks,

25:54.520 --> 25:55.200
but no thanks.

25:55.760 --> 25:56.720
I know.

25:56.920 --> 25:57.920
You still have that one person

25:57.920 --> 25:58.600
you're hung up on.

25:59.040 --> 26:00.160
Just do me a favor.

26:00.560 --> 26:01.720
If it really turns into a blind date,

26:01.800 --> 26:03.160
you gotta have my back.

26:05.200 --> 26:05.840
Look.

26:06.400 --> 26:07.520
This is my sister, Qu Bing.

26:07.600 --> 26:09.040
And this is her college roommate.

26:09.280 --> 26:10.760
A genius who graduated from Qingbei.

26:11.040 --> 26:11.920
Up-and-comer in the industry.

26:12.320 --> 26:12.920
Pretty, right?

26:16.760 --> 26:17.320
Fine, don't go then.

26:17.480 --> 26:17.960
Wait.

26:21.040 --> 26:21.520
I'll go.

26:21.960 --> 26:22.520
What time?

26:25.840 --> 26:26.440
Interested in her?

26:28.080 --> 26:28.880
Free meal.

26:29.560 --> 26:30.360
Why not?

26:33.120 --> 26:33.800
It's a deal then.

26:50.360 --> 26:50.840
This table.

27:00.280 --> 27:01.400
Sir, here's the menu.

27:01.520 --> 27:02.160
What would you like to order?

27:02.160 --> 27:02.680
Take a look first.

27:03.080 --> 27:03.520
Okay.

27:08.040 --> 27:08.680
Xing Wu,

27:09.520 --> 27:11.160
you look so good in that outfit.

27:11.600 --> 27:12.800
You're stealing my thunder.

27:13.680 --> 27:14.160
Really?

27:14.640 --> 27:15.520
Totally.

27:16.520 --> 27:17.640
You're not trying to

27:17.720 --> 27:18.920
become my brother-in-law, are you?

27:20.280 --> 27:21.240
You're overthinking it.

27:23.080 --> 27:23.520
I'm telling you,

27:23.520 --> 27:24.720
the restaurant I picked

27:24.720 --> 27:25.520
is definitely solid.

27:25.800 --> 27:27.520
They have great sea urchin egg custard

27:27.600 --> 27:28.160
and seafood noodles.

27:28.360 --> 27:29.280
All your favorites.

27:29.760 --> 27:30.680
I'm telling you now,

27:30.840 --> 27:32.360
I'm really just here for the free meal.

27:32.400 --> 27:33.200
Don't

27:33.520 --> 27:34.520
start anything later.

27:34.680 --> 27:35.600
I still have work.

27:35.880 --> 27:36.880
Don't worry.

27:37.080 --> 27:38.120
I won't interrupt your work.

27:40.920 --> 27:41.520
My brother's over there.

27:41.600 --> 27:42.080
Xing!

27:42.960 --> 27:43.520
Bing!

28:03.160 --> 28:04.160
He really is handsome.

29:03.520 --> 29:04.080
Hello.

29:06.480 --> 29:07.120
I'm Xing Wu.

29:14.880 --> 29:15.600
Xing Wu.

29:26.360 --> 29:26.880
Hello.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.720
I'm Qu Bing, Qu Xing's sister.

29:29.040 --> 29:30.160
This is my friend, Qing Ye.

29:30.560 --> 29:31.520
Also my college roommate.

29:33.880 --> 29:34.400
Qing Ye.

29:39.280 --> 29:39.800
Hello.

29:47.040 --> 29:47.560
Hello.

30:04.000 --> 30:04.640
Have a seat first.

30:05.360 --> 30:06.120
Don't just stand there.

30:06.280 --> 30:06.960
Come sit and talk.

30:07.280 --> 30:07.920
- Let's go.
- Okay.

30:26.640 --> 30:27.280
What's wrong?

30:27.760 --> 30:28.800
I'm a bit shy around new people.

30:39.040 --> 30:39.520
Thanks.

30:39.640 --> 30:40.040
Xing Wu,

30:40.040 --> 30:41.280
you really know how to order.

30:41.760 --> 30:43.280
These are all Qing Ye's favorites.

30:44.880 --> 30:45.400
Really?

30:45.840 --> 30:47.320
Guess she and I are pretty fated to meet.

30:51.320 --> 30:51.920
Eat up.

30:52.520 --> 30:53.160
Dig in.

31:09.560 --> 31:10.200
Thanks.

31:11.800 --> 31:12.360
You

31:12.800 --> 31:13.600
just got to Beijing?

31:16.720 --> 31:17.200
Yes.

31:17.840 --> 31:19.360
I was in college before.

31:20.080 --> 31:20.680
Now I'm in Beijing

31:21.560 --> 31:23.000
working on a project with my advisor.

31:23.360 --> 31:24.400
You just got to Beijing

31:25.240 --> 31:26.400
and you're already going on a blind date?

31:29.000 --> 31:30.320
I'm just here for the free meal.

31:30.760 --> 31:31.240
That's right.

31:31.520 --> 31:32.880
I asked him to come for a free meal.

31:33.120 --> 31:34.520
I was worried it might be awkward

31:34.640 --> 31:35.920
since it's our first meeting.

31:36.160 --> 31:36.640
Xing Wu,

31:36.840 --> 31:37.920
you're doing that nicely.

31:37.920 --> 31:38.560
Make one for me too.

31:39.960 --> 31:40.920
Why bother him?

31:41.160 --> 31:42.200
Can't you do it yourself?

31:42.520 --> 31:43.600
Just eat.

31:45.280 --> 31:46.240
You never used to

31:46.400 --> 31:47.560
wear glasses, right?

31:47.800 --> 31:48.680
How do you know?

31:49.040 --> 31:50.520
He studied too hard in school.

31:50.920 --> 31:51.880
Ruined his eyes.

31:52.560 --> 31:53.080
Just eat your food.

31:53.440 --> 31:54.200
I can tell.

31:55.680 --> 31:56.680
He really is hardworking.

31:57.000 --> 31:58.520
Your career must be going well.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.040
What about your love life?

32:00.640 --> 32:01.560
Any progress there?

32:01.800 --> 32:02.280
No.

32:05.440 --> 32:06.640
There's someone I've never

32:07.360 --> 32:08.080
been able to forget.

32:09.680 --> 32:10.400
Besides,

32:11.400 --> 32:12.360
I don't have the time.

32:15.320 --> 32:16.200
Can't forget?

32:18.200 --> 32:19.440
Then why not go find her?

32:23.920 --> 32:24.880
Afraid I'm not good enough for her.

32:25.960 --> 32:26.760
So I've been working hard

32:28.040 --> 32:29.280
to catch up to her.

32:30.360 --> 32:31.280
I can vouch for that.

32:32.000 --> 32:33.280
Xing Wu was either at competitions

32:33.560 --> 32:34.880
or working part-time whenever he had a break.

32:35.240 --> 32:36.400
You just couldn't find him.

32:36.680 --> 32:37.600
Forget about dating.

32:39.440 --> 32:40.040
Xing Wu,

32:40.640 --> 32:41.440
where are you from?

32:41.960 --> 32:42.960
Zhazhating in Anzi County.

32:43.080 --> 32:43.960
Zhazhating?

32:45.040 --> 32:45.600
Qing Ye,

32:45.640 --> 32:47.120
isn't your farmer-support project

32:47.240 --> 32:48.440
on Chang Island near there?

32:49.880 --> 32:51.040
What a coincidence.

32:51.440 --> 32:52.280
You have no idea

32:53.120 --> 32:54.960
how hard it was for Xing Wu

32:54.960 --> 32:56.160
to make it out of Zhazhating.

32:57.120 --> 32:57.800
Not really.

32:58.640 --> 32:59.520
But at least

33:00.200 --> 33:01.320
I finally made it to Beijing.

33:06.400 --> 33:06.880
Qing Ye,

33:07.320 --> 33:08.680
the dessert here is really good.

33:08.880 --> 33:09.680
Shall we order some?

33:10.160 --> 33:11.520
Yeah. I love desserts.

33:12.720 --> 33:13.240
Excuse me.

33:13.840 --> 33:14.840
One slice of cheesecake.

33:28.080 --> 33:29.280
We agreed I was paying for this meal.

33:29.520 --> 33:30.520
But you ended up covering it.

33:30.640 --> 33:31.520
I feel so bad.

33:31.680 --> 33:32.400
No big deal.

33:32.840 --> 33:33.520
I guess I met someone

33:33.640 --> 33:34.800
I clicked with at this meal.

33:41.680 --> 33:42.320
Let's add each other on WeChat.

33:53.520 --> 33:54.440
Add me too.

33:55.200 --> 33:55.960
Why are you butting in?

34:00.560 --> 34:01.120
Well,

34:01.520 --> 34:02.120
we're heading out.

34:02.440 --> 34:02.920
You two carry on.

34:03.720 --> 34:04.400
Where are we going?

34:04.640 --> 34:05.160
Let's go.

34:05.200 --> 34:05.640
Wait, I...

34:05.640 --> 34:06.760
I shouldn't have brought you today.

34:06.800 --> 34:08.080
Can't I add her on WeChat?

34:08.120 --> 34:08.880
You idiot.

34:09.440 --> 34:09.880
Let's go.

34:26.760 --> 34:27.600
My ride's here.

34:28.239 --> 34:29.400
Where do you live? I'll take you home.

34:30.639 --> 34:31.159
No need.

34:32.080 --> 34:32.960
I called a cab too.

34:32.960 --> 34:34.280
My place isn't far from here.

34:34.520 --> 34:35.159
You go first.

34:39.400 --> 34:39.880
Then

34:40.800 --> 34:41.560
we'll keep in touch on WeChat.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.239
Bye.

34:44.679 --> 34:45.159
Bye.

34:50.080 --> 34:50.840
Get some rest.

35:09.640 --> 35:10.800
Sunshine.

35:14.560 --> 35:15.440
Lighthouse.

35:35.120 --> 35:36.520
Qing Ye!

35:38.440 --> 35:40.200
Hello. Long time no see.

35:40.200 --> 35:41.840
Ye, hello. It's been ages.

35:43.520 --> 35:44.800
You brought gifts.

35:44.960 --> 35:46.120
You're too kind.

35:46.160 --> 35:46.600
Here.

35:47.120 --> 35:47.800
Careful.

35:47.840 --> 35:48.640
Missed you.

35:51.280 --> 35:52.240
What are you doing here?

35:52.760 --> 35:53.840
I couldn't find a job before.

35:54.000 --> 35:55.080
Wu recommended me to work here.

35:55.360 --> 35:56.560
Ping is my dad's

35:56.600 --> 35:57.400
right-hand man now.

35:57.560 --> 35:58.040
That's right.

35:58.400 --> 35:59.400
Cao Ping

35:59.400 --> 36:00.840
is smart and reliable.

36:00.920 --> 36:02.120
He's in charge of most of

36:02.200 --> 36:03.520
the operations at the farm now.

36:04.720 --> 36:05.760
I see.

36:06.640 --> 36:07.600
Actually, I came here

36:08.080 --> 36:09.200
because I have something important

36:09.200 --> 36:09.960
to tell you guys.

36:10.480 --> 36:11.760
Right now, we mainly sell seafood

36:12.040 --> 36:13.760
through middlemen who come to pick it up.

36:14.600 --> 36:16.000
So the farming chain

36:16.000 --> 36:16.760
and sales channels

36:16.760 --> 36:17.760
are indeed a bit limited.

36:18.560 --> 36:19.120
So

36:19.160 --> 36:19.680
the most important part

36:19.680 --> 36:21.200
of the plan

36:21.200 --> 36:22.000
is industrial upgrading.

36:22.440 --> 36:23.200
Basically, it's turning

36:23.200 --> 36:24.640
the traditional farming model

36:24.920 --> 36:26.360
into a multi-dimensional,

36:26.520 --> 36:28.400
comprehensive marine industry,

36:28.680 --> 36:30.200
and building an online-to-offline

36:30.440 --> 36:31.480
direct sales network.

36:31.800 --> 36:33.320
If we can build

36:33.360 --> 36:35.240
a cold chain transport center nearby,

36:35.680 --> 36:36.320
Chang Island's seafood

36:36.320 --> 36:37.200
could be delivered

36:37.200 --> 36:38.440
to the table

36:38.520 --> 36:39.400
as quickly as possible

36:39.440 --> 36:40.080
at its best quality.

36:40.240 --> 36:41.320
That would also drive prices up.

36:41.960 --> 36:42.840
And look.

36:43.760 --> 36:45.000
Chang Island

36:45.200 --> 36:46.480
has such great scenery.

36:46.480 --> 36:48.040
It's perfect for developing tourism.

36:48.600 --> 36:50.200
This area could have

36:50.480 --> 36:51.520
sightseeing boardwalks,

36:51.720 --> 36:53.400
plus sea fishing,

36:53.400 --> 36:54.360
family beachcombing,

36:54.720 --> 36:55.320
and

36:55.480 --> 36:56.840
summer bonfires.

36:57.600 --> 36:58.920
Also an ocean amusement park.

36:59.400 --> 36:59.920
And the beach.

37:00.480 --> 37:01.120
Exactly.

37:01.120 --> 37:02.400
Chang Island's scenery is so nice.

37:02.440 --> 37:03.640
We should've developed tourism long ago.

37:04.280 --> 37:05.560
And you know,

37:05.640 --> 37:07.400
the government is now really supporting

37:07.400 --> 37:08.080
rural revitalization.

37:08.160 --> 37:09.080
Marine ranching

37:09.080 --> 37:10.440
is a key area they're backing.

37:10.960 --> 37:12.080
If we do this well,

37:12.320 --> 37:12.960
we might even

37:13.080 --> 37:14.520
get government subsidies.

37:14.920 --> 37:15.560
Since we have

37:15.560 --> 37:16.960
government support,

37:17.000 --> 37:18.240
we need to fully cooperate.

37:18.560 --> 37:19.440
I'll report back

37:19.440 --> 37:21.040
to the company when I return.

37:21.120 --> 37:21.720
After that,

37:21.720 --> 37:22.320
we'll send

37:22.320 --> 37:23.360
our colleagues over

37:23.360 --> 37:23.880
for due diligence.

37:24.400 --> 37:26.520
Let's push this plan forward together.

37:26.600 --> 37:26.960
Okay.

37:27.080 --> 37:28.040
You can coordinate

37:28.080 --> 37:29.320
the specific details with Mr. Cao.

37:29.480 --> 37:30.000
No problem.

37:30.600 --> 37:31.160
Pleasure working with you.

37:31.480 --> 37:32.080
Pleasure working with you.

37:40.640 --> 37:41.800
I can't believe how much Cao Ping

37:41.800 --> 37:42.560
has changed over the years.

37:43.200 --> 37:43.720
Yeah.

37:43.760 --> 37:44.880
He's worked really hard all these years.

37:45.800 --> 37:46.520
You're leaving already?

37:46.840 --> 37:47.520
Why not stay on the island

37:47.520 --> 37:48.320
a few more days?

37:49.440 --> 37:51.560
I want to go see Grandma

37:51.800 --> 37:52.800
and walk around Zhazhating.

37:54.840 --> 37:56.320
It's been so long since we last

37:56.320 --> 37:57.400
toured the island.

37:59.320 --> 38:00.880
If only we could all get together again.

38:03.640 --> 38:05.120
Let those good memories

38:06.600 --> 38:07.720
stay in that summer.

38:08.080 --> 38:08.920
We'll look forward.

38:10.880 --> 38:11.560
You're right.

38:11.960 --> 38:12.760
Look forward.

38:38.880 --> 38:39.520
Grandma.

38:41.320 --> 38:42.680
I'm late.

38:46.560 --> 38:47.640
I came to see you.

38:50.520 --> 38:52.200
Are you doing well

38:54.760 --> 38:55.680
in that world?

38:58.720 --> 38:59.360
Grandma.

39:01.520 --> 39:02.560
I miss you so much.

39:17.320 --> 39:19.080
Seven yuan is too expensive. You...

39:19.320 --> 39:19.800
Definitely.

39:20.600 --> 39:21.160
Qing Ye,

39:21.200 --> 39:22.640
we meet again so soon.

39:23.280 --> 39:24.560
I'm here on a business trip.

39:25.400 --> 39:26.920
I left in a hurry last time.

39:27.040 --> 39:28.520
Didn't get a chance to look around.

39:28.640 --> 39:29.760
Call me if you need anything.

39:29.800 --> 39:31.280
Got it. Thanks, Mr. Zhao.

39:46.840 --> 39:47.520
Qing Ye.

39:47.840 --> 39:48.560
Ms. Zhao.

39:49.760 --> 39:51.000
I just made some coffee.

39:51.080 --> 39:51.920
Have a cup.

39:51.960 --> 39:52.800
Thanks.

39:53.040 --> 39:54.320
Let me know if you need anything.

39:55.640 --> 39:56.400
Ms. Zhao.

40:22.040 --> 40:22.840
Qing Ye, you're back.

40:24.440 --> 40:25.680
Try the upgraded version

40:25.800 --> 40:27.200
of Zhazha Drink.

40:28.080 --> 40:28.560
Okay.

40:30.720 --> 40:31.760
Give me your honest opinion.

41:13.960 --> 41:14.640
Auntie.

41:15.400 --> 41:18.000
Ye, you're finally here.

41:18.720 --> 41:19.520
Give me a hug.

41:23.800 --> 41:24.960
You said you'd be right back.

41:24.960 --> 41:26.240
That was hardly "right back".

41:26.240 --> 41:28.040
I got sleepy waiting.

41:28.320 --> 41:29.600
I thought you got lost.

41:30.160 --> 41:31.160
I left in a hurry last time.

41:31.280 --> 41:32.440
I wanted to walk around

41:32.440 --> 41:32.960
nearby.

41:33.040 --> 41:33.240
Look.

41:33.760 --> 41:34.920
They made me all these drinks.

41:34.920 --> 41:35.920
I've had so much to drink.

41:36.080 --> 41:37.200
I gotta go to the bathroom,

41:37.200 --> 41:37.600
Auntie.

41:38.720 --> 41:39.000
Come back.

41:39.320 --> 41:39.640
Come back.

41:40.200 --> 41:40.720
Come here.

41:43.080 --> 41:43.520
Here.

41:50.240 --> 41:50.760
How is it?

41:50.920 --> 41:51.920
Feels totally different now,

41:51.920 --> 41:52.680
right?

41:53.080 --> 41:55.040
Wet and dry separated.

41:55.240 --> 41:56.760
No more worrying about someone

41:56.760 --> 41:58.400
banging on the door while you're showering.

42:02.040 --> 42:02.480
After you.

42:21.240 --> 42:21.880
Don't move.

42:27.160 --> 42:28.920
So pretty, Auntie.

42:28.920 --> 42:30.080
Your updo skills

42:30.080 --> 42:31.280
are getting better and better.

42:31.280 --> 42:32.440
One last step.

42:33.880 --> 42:34.640
Okay. Done.

42:35.840 --> 42:36.280
Gorgeous.

42:36.640 --> 42:38.440
As expected of Anzi County's number one.

42:39.960 --> 42:42.600
I have to keep up with the times.

42:42.840 --> 42:44.000
Need to learn new things.

42:44.000 --> 42:45.040
Can't just keep doing

42:45.040 --> 42:46.000
the same old hairstyles.

42:46.040 --> 42:47.400
I've learned a lot online

42:47.800 --> 42:48.840
lately.

42:49.840 --> 42:51.080
I realized this craft

42:51.160 --> 42:52.440
needs fresh ideas.

42:52.800 --> 42:53.840
Otherwise,

42:53.880 --> 42:55.120
why would young people

42:55.120 --> 42:56.600
come to me to do their hair?

42:58.080 --> 42:58.960
Thumbs up.

43:01.200 --> 43:02.680
Sweetie, you're so pretty.

43:04.400 --> 43:05.040
Auntie,

43:06.240 --> 43:08.600
if I ever get married,

43:09.200 --> 43:10.640
I'm definitely having you do my hair.

43:16.440 --> 43:17.360
You have a boyfriend?

43:21.920 --> 43:22.800
Take a picture with me.

43:23.760 --> 43:25.080
For memory's sake.

43:25.120 --> 43:26.280
You're hardly ever back here.

43:27.800 --> 43:28.240
Come on.

43:29.960 --> 43:31.320
One, two, three.

43:31.680 --> 43:32.080
Okay.

43:32.680 --> 43:33.040
Alright.

43:33.120 --> 43:34.200
Stay here for a bit.

43:34.240 --> 43:35.280
I'm going to cook.
